  "summary": "Broadband aggregation: residential CPEs dial PPPoE sessions over an access network to a BNG (Broadband Network Gateway). RADIUS authenticates subscribers and returns per-session QoS/ACL. BNG terminates PPP, places subscriber into VRF INET, and uplinks to the IP/MPLS core.",
