    {
      "id": "t_flow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Subscriber bring-up:\n  1. PADI/PADO discovery\n  2. PADR/PADS session setup\n  3. LCP + IPCP negotiation\n  4. CHAP to RADIUS\n  5. RADIUS returns: framed-ip,\n     QoS profile, ACLs, MTU\n  6. BNG installs subscriber state\n     (1:1 model) in VRF INET",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 360,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "color": "#e2e8f0",
      "showBackground": true,
      "backgroundColor": "#0f172a",
      "backgroundOpacity": 0.85,
      "backgroundPadding": 10,
      "showBorder": true,
      "borderColor": "#a855f7",
      "borderWidth": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t_coa",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Change-of-Auth (CoA):\n  RADIUS pushes bandwidth change\n  mid-session -> BNG applies\n  new QoS without session drop.\n  Used for speed upgrades,\n  walled-garden on overdue bill.",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 240,
